    "innovation": "This paper reports on the first scientific deep-sea drilling expedition in the central Arctic Ocean (ACEX), which recovered a continuous Cenozoic sediment core providing the first direct, comprehensive record of the region's long-term paleoceanographic history and challenging previous assumptions about its paleoenvironment.",
